gin="03:51.809" end="03:52.766">out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我希望这一切都会成功</span></p><p begin="03:53.229" end="03:56.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51"><span begin="03:53.229" end="03:53.454">But</span> <span begin="03:53.454" end="03:53.700">you</span> <span begin="03:53.700" end="03:53.946">know</span> <span begin="03:53.946" end="03:54.189">how</span> <span begin="03:54.189" end="03:54.426">much</span> <span begin="03:54.426" end="03:54.679">you</span> <span begin="03:54.679" end="03:54.912">broke</span> <span begin="03:54.912" end="03:55.148">me</span> <span begin="03:55.148" end="03:55.648">a</span><span begin="03:55.648" end="03:56.120">part</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但你知道 你令我内心多么分崩离析</span></p><p begin="03:56.120" end="03:59.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52"><span begin="03:56.120" end="03:56.349">I'm</span> <span begin="03:56.349" end="03:56.826">done</span> <span begin="03:56.826" end="03:57.094">with</span> <span begin="03:57.094" end="03:57.373">you,</span> <span begin="03:57.580" end="03:57.797">I'm</span> <span begin="03:57.797" end="03:58.279">ig</span><span begin="03:58.279" end="03:58.764">no</span><span begin="03:58.764" end="03:59.007">ring</span> <span begin="03:59.007" end="03:59.480">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我已经受够你了 我要将你忽视</span></p><p begin="03:59.480" end="04:01.924" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53"><span begin="03:59.480" end="03:59.722">I</span> <span begin="03:59.722" end="03:59.971">don't</span> <span begin="03:59.971" end="04:00.200">wan</span><span begin="04:00.200" end="04:00.450">na</span> <span begin="04:00.450" end="04:01.924">know</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不想再了解了</span></p></div></body></tt>